    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50809" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vibo</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vibon</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in the territory of the
				Bruttii</i>, now <i>Monteleone</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 4,
			9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5, 10, § 73</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Att.
				16, 6, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 6, §
				645</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vibōnensis</span></b> , e, adj.,
				<i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
			Vibo</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					21, 51, 4</span></i>
			 sqq.; <i><span class="en">Cic. Att. 16, 6, 1</span></i>.</div>
